menu "Thoth CSI transmitter"
    config THOTH_CSI_PROBE_RATE_HZ
        int "Requested CSI probe rate (packets per second)"
        range 1 1000
        default 100
        help
            Requested ESP-NOW probe rate. Begin at 100 and measure receiver
            output_dropped and queue_depth before increasing the load.
            This is a requested rate, not a guaranteed reception rate.
endmenu
